Unreal Engine 5.5 upgrade, Performance Enhancements, AI Aiming &amp; Vulnerability Improvements, Recoil &amp; Weapon Sway Overhaul, Shooting Sound Tweaks, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Gray Zone Warfare, and experience a much smoother and authentic open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine 5.5 Upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance Enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Aiming &amp; Vulnerability Improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Sway Overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recoil Overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting Sound Tweaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPV Movement Improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Server Region - Mainland China</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Death Screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Bullet Penetration through skull and bones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced Rewards for Strike Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key drop frequency in Fort Narith fixed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved scope visibility under specific weather conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated the NVIDIA DLSS plugin to version 8.1.0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated to AMD FSR 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fixes &amp; improvements. See the full Changelog on Steam News.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/55b9af672c0124e2347eed4cfd4b57a2.poster.avif?t=1772468551\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479810/extras/55b9af672c0124e2347eed4cfd4b57a2.webm?t=17724685